<title>JAPAN: Japan offers 500 bln yen in 1.6 pct 6-year bonds.</title>
<headline>Japan offers 500 bln yen in 1.6 pct 6-year bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said on Tuesday it was offering 500 billion yen in 1.6 pct six-year bonds through a price-competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at noon (0300 GMT) and the results will be announced at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT).</p>
<p>The issue date will be March 21 and the maturity date will be March 20, 2003.</p>
</text>
